{
  "description": "ICU MessageFormat within the catalogs' subset, rendered alike by @household/i18n (intl-messageformat over Node's ICU) and the server's Go renderer (internal/platform/i18n), and the language a member is shown. The Slavic plural forms are the most common bug in naively translated apps (PRD 03 §9).",
